  replacement: l2_replacement=srrip, llc_replacement=ship
    because: Since the search is stalled and L2C is being swept, testing SRRIP at the L2 will determine if scan resistance performs better than SHiP in the presence of the newly introduced LLC next-line prefetcher.
  concurrency: l2_mshr=64, llc_mshr=64
    because: Sweeping the L2C as requested to test if increasing L2 miss-handling registers to 64 can better support the memory-level parallelism demands of the new prefetch configuration.

